       "text": "I haven't entered this order yet because the dose looks wrong.\n\n**Amlodipine 50 mg once daily is 5 times the usual maximum.** Adults normally start at 2.5\u20135 mg once daily, and the most anyone should get is 10 mg once daily. A 50 mg dose could cause a dangerous drop in blood pressure and reflex tachycardia (a fast heart rate as the body compensates). It could also have effects that last a long time, because amlodipine stays in the body for a long time.\n\nThis looks like it could be a typo for **5 mg** (an extra zero).\n\nCan you confirm the dose you want?\n- **5 mg** by mouth once daily (a usual starting dose)\n- **10 mg** by mouth once daily (the maximum dose)\n- Something else, with the clinical reason\n\nI'll enter the order as soon as you reply."
